Legacy Tang runtime corpus
-----------------------------

- 1933 edition of 唐詩三百首, the primary witness for 49 works:
  https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:NLC416-17jh000616-101322_%E5%94%90%E8%A9%A9%E4%B8%89%E7%99%BE%E9%A6%96.pdf?oldid=845982203
- 1933 edition of 本事詩, the primary witness only for 題都城南莊 because
  the selected 1933 唐詩三百首 does not include it:
  https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:NLC511-027032013010163-20835_%E6%9C%AC%E4%BA%8B%E8%A9%A9.pdf
- 1705 御定全唐詩 scans, used as secondary witnesses:
  https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/Category:%E5%BE%A1%E5%AE%9A%E5%85%A8%E5%94%90%E8%A9%A9

The 50 legacy Tang works have two recorded scan witnesses.
The corpus is an independently reviewed practical selection, not an
authoritative scholarly critical edition.

